<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>My Blog</title>

<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
body {
background: #f5f5f5;
}

.blog-header { background: #212529; color: white;
padding: 50px 20px; text-align: center;
}

.blog-card { height: 100%;
transition: transform 0.3s;
}

.blog-card:hover {
transform: translateY(-5px);
}

.blog-card img { height: 200px; object-fit: cover;
}

.footer {
background: #212529; color: white;
padding: 25px; text-align: center;
 
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
.blog-header { padding: 35px 15px;
}

.blog-header h1 { font-size: 30px;
}

.blog-card img { height: 180px;
}
}

@media (max-width: 576px) {
.blog-header h1 { font-size: 25px;
}

.blog-header p { font-size: 14px;
}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">
<div class="container">
<a class="navbar-brand" href="#home">My Blog</a>

<button class="navbar-toggler" type="button"
data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarMenu" aria-controls="navbarMenu" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
<span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
</button>

<div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarMenu">
<ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#home">Home</a></li>
<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#blogs">Blogs</a></li>
<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#about">About</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
 
</nav>

<header class="blog-header" id="home">
<h1>Welcome to My Blog</h1>
<p>Sharing ideas about technology, coding and learning</p>
</header>

<main class="container my-5">
<h2 class="text-center mb-4" id="blogs">Latest Blogs</h2>

<div class="row g-4">
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
<article class="card blog-card shadow-sm">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
class="card-img-top" alt="Laptop used for coding">
<div class="card-body">
<h3 class="h5 card-title">Introduction to Web Development</h3>
<p class="card-text">Learn the basics of HTML, CSS and JavaScript.</p>
<a href="#about" class="btn btn-primary">Read More</a>
</div>
</article>
</div>

<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
<article class="card blog-card shadow-sm">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
class="card-img-top" alt="Programming code displayed on a screen">
<div class="card-body">
<h3 class="h5 card-title">Why Learn Programming?</h3>
<p class="card-text">Programming helps us solve problems and build applications.</p>
<a href="#about" class="btn btn-primary">Read More</a>
</div>
</article>
</div>

<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
<article class="card blog-card shadow-sm">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515879218367-8466d910aaa4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
class="card-img-top" alt="Code on a laptop screen">
<div class="card-body">
<h3 class="h5 card-title">Getting Started with Bootstrap</h3>
<p class="card-text">Create responsive websites with ready-made components.</p>
<a href="#about" class="btn btn-primary">Read More</a>
</div>
 
</article>
</div>
</div>

<section class="mt-5 text-center" id="about">
<h2>About This Blog</h2>
<p>This blog is a Web Designing Lab project about coding and web development.</p>
</section>
</main>

<footer class="footer">
<p class="mb-0">© 2026 Shlok Purwar | Web Designing Lab</p>
</footer>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
